# Requires the "REST Client" VS Code extension. Run from top to bottom.
# First open the browser snippet in requests/socket-test.js to watch the events arrive.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Log in as the admin
# @name admin
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@grace.test",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Run the scheduler now (the demo button). Run it twice: the second time sends nothing.
POST {{gateway}}/api/scheduler/run
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### 3. See today's tasks
GET {{gateway}}/api/tasks/board
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Forget today's events and finished tasks, so the demo can be run again
POST {{gateway}}/api/scheduler/reset-today
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
